abstract: >-
  Lemma frequency list of Ingush (inh), a Nakh language of the North Caucasus: 27,774 words (lemma + part of speech)
  computed from the PaydaDosh corpus of 2.46 million Ingush word tokens in five genres, ranked by frequency times
  dispersion across genres.
